OL,3,GNEWSAEarly years staff to vote over
OL,4,Anurseries strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FNursery workers in Barnsley are to be
OL,7,Fformally balloted over strike action in
OL,8,Fa row over a change to pensions.
OL,10,FLast year, the council agreed to
OL,11,Ftransfer six of its nurseries - in
OL,12,FThurnscoe, Worsbrough, Athersley,
OL,13,FGrimethorpe, Penistone and Wombwell -
OL,14,Fto another provider after a review of
OL,15,Fits sites.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
