OL,3,GNEWSAEarly years staff to vote over
OL,4,Anurseries strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the GMB union said despite
OL,7,Frepeated promises that workers would
OL,8,Fkeep their existing local government
OL,9,Fpensions, staff had since been told
OL,10,Fthey would instead be moved onto the
OL,11,Fprivate provider's statutory pension
OL,12,Fscheme.
OL,14,FReform UK council leader William Brown
OL,15,Fsaid while he respected the right to
OL,16,Fstrike, the authority would not allow
OL,17,Fthe threat of industrial action to
OL,18,F"dictate our decisions".
